The project's conventions, architecture, domain model and known landmines live
in `CLAUDE.md` at the repository root. Read it before making changes, and treat
its rules as binding.

Before proposing a change, run `npm run verify` — it is the same gate CI runs
(typecheck, lint, format check, build).
